*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
.DS_Store

# Raw CBOE chains: ~1.3 MB per snapshot (~2.3 GB/year at hourly capture), so they
# cannot be version-controlled. They are a same-session audit convenience only.
#
# The DURABLE record is the distilled output, which IS committed:
#   data/snapshots/<date>/<time>/greeks_*.csv.gz   moving columns, per snapshot
#   data/snapshots/oi/*.csv.gz                     open interest, content-addressed
#   data/snapshots/<date>/<time>/meta.json         provenance + reduction audit
#   data/snapshots/index.jsonl                     append-only capture log
#
# Dropping raw is safe for GEX specifically: every excluded contract carries zero open
# interest and zero volume, verified to leave gross GEX unchanged to 1e-10. See
# src/gammamap/distill.py.
data/snapshots/**/chain_*.json.gz
